  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2056\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_56stars_Black_Stripe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150826055325\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 56stars Black Stripe.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_56stars_Black_Stripe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2052\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2052\">2052</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 7, 2056</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2060\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2060\">2060</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All elligable voters who participate</small><br /><small>51% of the vote votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">48.3%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Forest\" title=\"Dan Forest\">Dan Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Brandon Tran\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Democratic\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Indiana\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Maryland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Owen Wood\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Sam Hodman\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">39.9%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">40.1%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Sarah Perez\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Andrew Markwalter\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Green\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Libertarian\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Colorado\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Kentucky\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Matilda Belrose\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Harlan Monroe\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">12.5%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">7.5%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Evalyn_Jacobi\" title=\"Evalyn Jacobi\">Evalyn Jacobi</a><br />\nDemocratic\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Forest\" title=\"Dan Forest\">Dan Forest</a><br />\nDemocratic\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>2056 United States Presidential Election </b> was&#160;the 68th quadrennial presidential election. Democratic Party Candidate Dan Forest won the election thanks to having the majority of second and third choice votes.. This was the first election where a candidate with the most votes on the first ballot lost, leading to President Elect <a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Forest\" title=\"Dan Forest\">Dan Forest</a> to promise only a single term as President.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Background\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Background</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Nominations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nominations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Democratic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Democratic</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Conservative\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Conservative</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Green\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Green</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Libertarian\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Libertarian</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Result\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Result</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the aftermath of <a href=\"/wiki/World_War_III\" title=\"World War III\">World War III</a>, the United States became split upon on the decision of what the post-war world would look like and be maintained.&#160;\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nominations\">Nominations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Democratic\">Democratic</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">While respected as a competent and moderate Vice President, Forest was not President Jacobi's first choice to succeed her. After repeated attempts to push Secretary of the Space Force, James E. Knight to seek the Democratic nomination, the Progressive Caucus and President Jacobi endorsed Forest as the nominee. To the surprise of many in the party, Forest's laid back attitude struck a chord with the nation, exhausted by war, frozen conflicts, and economic upheaval.</span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conservative\">Conservative</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Green\">Green</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Libertarian\">Libertarian</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Result\">Result</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2056%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The results were surprising when Conservative candidate Brandon Tran's bipartisan strategy to win the Progressive and Conservative votes allowed him to gain enough votes to secure the majority of the first ballots. However, Brandon Tran's neglect of the lower parties had resulted in Dan Forest's domination of being in their second and third choices. It gave him enough power to ultimately win more than 51% of the the vote to narrowly steal the election.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261118233723\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2717/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12852/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3664/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 10/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032169/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   94.857      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   94.857      1 -total\n 79.06%   74.998      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 29.03%   27.534     11 Template:Ifempty\n 18.18%   17.240      6 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  5.99%    5.685      1 Template:Flagicon\n  3.93%    3.732      1 Template:Country_data_United_States\n  1.90%    1.804     48 Template:!-\n  1.88%    1.785      1 Template:Flagicon/core\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1873-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261118233